# Confetti for a personal best or a golden catch (1.2.0): little bits popping up (1), spread out
# at the top (2), then fluttering down (3). Tiny flat bits, no outline (like emotes/sparkle).
name: confetti
size: 16x10
palette:
  P #ff7eb6
  Y #f7d84a
  C #5fd3e8
  G #7ad06a
  O #ff9a3c
  W #fffaf0

